]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids shows January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 147% of normal in May to June and 41% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 45% and February to March at 51%. Grid 17865 had its driest year in 1954 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
